error[E0277]: the input collection must be bounded (`Bounded`), but has bound `hydro_lang::prelude::Unbounded`
  --> tests/compile-fail/stable/sliced_clone_unbounded.rs:16:13
   |
16 |       let _ = sliced! {
   |  _____________^
17 | |         let batch = use::batch(input, nondet!(/** test */));
18 | |         let count = use::clone(count);
19 | |         batch.cross_singleton(count)
20 | |     };
   | |_____^ required here
   |
   = help: the trait `IsBounded` is not implemented for `hydro_lang::prelude::Unbounded`
   = note: strengthen the boundedness upstream, or consider a different API
   = note: to intentionally process a non-deterministic snapshot or batch, you may want to use a `sliced!` region; this introduces non-determinism, so avoid it unless necessary
help: the following other types implement trait `Slicable<'a, L>`
