   | / impl<'a, T: Clone, L: Location<'a>, B: SingletonBound + IsBounded> Slicable<'a, L::DropConsistency>
   | |     for Cloned<crate::live_collections::Singleton<T, L, B>>
   | |___________________________________________________________^ `hydro_lang::live_collections::sliced::style::Cloned<hydro_lang::prelude::Singleton<T, L, B>>`
...
   | / impl<'a, T: Clone, L: Location<'a>, B: OptionalBound + IsBounded> Slicable<'a, L::DropConsistency>
   | |     for Cloned<crate::live_collections::Optional<T, L, B>>
   | |__________________________________________________________^ `hydro_lang::live_collections::sliced::style::Cloned<hydro_lang::prelude::Optional<T, L, B>>`
   = note: required for `hydro_lang::live_collections::sliced::style::Cloned<hydro_lang::prelude::Singleton<i32, hydro_lang::prelude::Process<'a, P1>, hydro_lang::prelude::Unbounded>>` to implement `Slicable<'_, hydro_lang::prelude::Process<'a, P1>>`
   = note: this error originates in the macro `$crate::__sliced_parse_uses__` which comes from the expansion of the macro `sliced` (in Nightly builds, run with -Z macro-backtrace for more info)

